  "body": "Currently the paragraph distance and the font size is the same at 1rem. I find the text much easier to read, if the font size is 0.9rem (which also matches the old spec). This could be just something I need to get used to, but it may be worth discussing. Here is a comparison screenshot:\r\n\r\n| 0.9rem | 1rem |\r\n|-----------|---------|\r\n| ![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16312324/109986090-58019180-7cfd-11eb-9bc6-debe4a255b07.png) | ![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/16312324/109986543-c2b2cd00-7cfd-11eb-8f47-abc6cd414196.png) |\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
